  "id": "elm",
  "term": "ELM",
  "definition": "ELM stands for extreme learning machine, a neural network approach described here as using only one hidden layer instead of deeper networks in a physics-informed framework. In this context, it is trained directly from a combined loss based on equations and conditions using least-squares optimisation.",
